    "default": "on",
    "detail": "Offer the I/O brokers' tools (disk_read / disk_list / net_fetch) in the gt-vault MCP server, whatever vault_mcp says (0.21.0; on by default).\n\non   disk_read / disk_list / net_fetch are offered, even with the vault tools off  (default)\noff  no broker tool is offered or callable\nThe broker is the narrow, gated route for reading outside the vault: allow list at\nonce, anything else asks for your presence, credentials never. Turning it off leaves\nonly Claude Code's general Read tool for such reads.",
    "change": "/gt:gt-settings io_tools <value>"
